&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 267px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 0px none ; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 0px none ; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 16px; text-align: center"&gt;新規発行（処分）前の株価&lt;/p&gt;
